<div class="card-content">
<h2 class="card-title">J.R.R. Tolkien Collection</h2>
<p class="card-text">The original manuscripts, working drafts, and related works of J.R.R. Tolkien's celebrated works, including <em>The Hobbit</em>, <em>The Lord of the Rings</em>, and <em>Farmer Giles of Ham</em>.</p>
<a class="card-btn btn-secondary_gold" href="/library/archives/tolkien.php">Learn more</a></div>
<div class="anchor_horizontal-blue">&nbsp;</div>
